<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Dokumentasi API' }) %>
</head>
<body class="hold-transition sidebar-mini layout-fixed">
<div class="wrapper">

    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
    <%- include('partials/sidebar') %>

    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <div class="content-header">
            <div class="container-fluid">
                <div class="row mb-2">
                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <h1 class="m-0">Dokumentasi API</h1>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <ol class="breadcrumb float-sm-right">
                            <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/dashboard">Dasbor</a></li>
                            <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Dokumentasi</li>
                        </ol>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="content">
            <div class="container-fluid">
                    <!-- Introduction Card -->
                    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800 p-4 md:p-6 mb-8 fade-in break-words">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 md:mb-6">
                            <div class="pr-2">
                                <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100">Pendahuluan</h3>
                                <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Memulai dengan WhatsApp API</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14 bg-linear-to-br from-blue-100/10 to-blue-200/20 dark:from-blue-950/40 dark:to-blue-900/30 rounded-xl md:rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner flex-shrink-0">
                                <i class="ri-book-2-line text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-lg md:text-2xl"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="prose max-w-none break-words">
                            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-4">Halaman ini menjelaskan cara berinteraksi secara programatis dengan layanan WhatsApp Webhook dan memberikan gambaran fitur yang tersedia di dasbor.</p>

                            <div class="bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-950/20 rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 mb-4">
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300 mb-2">Metode Autentikasi</h4>
                                <p class="text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 mb-3 text-sm">Semua endpoint API dilindungi. Tersedia <strong class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">dua</strong> cara untuk autentikasi:</p>
                                <ol class="list-decimal list-outside ml-5 space-y-2 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 text-sm">
                                    <li><strong class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">Cookie Sesi</strong> – Masuk melalui dasbor web, lalu salin cookie <code class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/30 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs break-all">auth-token</code> dari browser dan sertakan pada setiap request.</li>
                                    <li><strong class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400">Kunci API</strong> – Buat kunci di halaman <em>Kunci API</em>. Kirim lewat header <code class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/30 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs break-all">X-API-KEY</code> atau parameter query <code class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/30 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs break-all">?api_key=</code>.</li>
                                </ol>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- REST API Endpoints Card -->
                    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800 p-4 md:p-6 mb-8 fade-in overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 md:mb-6">
                            <div class="pr-2">
                                <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100">Endpoint REST API</h3>
                                <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Endpoint yang tersedia untuk integrasi API</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14 bg-linear-to-br from-green-100/10 to-green-200/20 dark:from-green-950/40 dark:to-green-900/30 rounded-xl md:rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner flex-shrink-0">
                                <i class="ri-code-s-slash-line text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-lg md:text-2xl"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="overflow-x-auto -mx-4 px-4 md:mx-0 md:px-0">
                            <table class="w-full min-w-[500px]">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr class="border-b-2 border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800">
                                        <th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm">Metode</th>
                                        <th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm">Endpoint</th>
                                        <th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm">Deskripsi</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 dark:divide-slate-800">
                                    <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition-colors">
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4">
                                            <span class="inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-lg">GET</span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4">
                                            <code class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-950 text-black dark:text-slate-200 border border-gray-250 dark:border-slate-850 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-mono">/status</code>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                                            <div class="text-xs mb-1">Cek status koneksi dan QR code</div>
                                            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-500 uppercase font-medium">Auth: Cookie/API Key</div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition-colors">
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4">
                                            <span class="inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-950/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-400 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-lg">POST</span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4">
                                            <code class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-950 text-black dark:text-slate-200 border border-gray-250 dark:border-slate-850 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-mono">/send-message</code>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                                            <div class="text-xs mb-2">Kirim satu pesan WhatsApp</div>
                                            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-500 uppercase font-medium mb-1">Body Parameters:</div>
                                            <div class="space-y-1">
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">to</span> (number)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">message</span> (text)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">reply_to_id</span> (optional)</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition-colors">
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4">
                                            <span class="inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-lg">POST</span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4">
                                            <code class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-950 text-black dark:text-slate-200 border border-gray-250 dark:border-slate-850 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-mono">/send-document</code>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                                            <div class="text-xs mb-2">Kirim dokumen atau attachment</div>
                                            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-500 uppercase font-medium mb-1">Body Parameters:</div>
                                            <div class="space-y-1">
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">to</span> (number)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">url</span> / <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">base64</span> / <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">document</span> (file)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">fileName</span> (optional)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">mimetype</span> (optional)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">caption</span> (optional)</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition-colors">
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4">
                                            <span class="inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-400 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-lg">POST</span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4">
                                            <code class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-950 text-black dark:text-slate-200 border border-gray-250 dark:border-slate-850 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-mono">/send-interactive</code>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="py-4 px-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                                            <div class="text-xs mb-2">Kirim pesan interaktif dengan tombol atau list</div>
                                            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-500 uppercase font-medium mb-1">Body Parameters:</div>
                                            <div class="space-y-1">
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">to</span> (number)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">text</span> (message)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">footer</span> (optional)</div>
                                                <div class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 border border-gray-100/80 dark:border-slate-850 p-1 rounded"><span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-450">interactiveButtons</span> (array)</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Code Examples -->
                        <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Example with API Key:</h4>
                                <div class="bg-gray-950 text-slate-100 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto border border-slate-900">
                                    <pre class="text-xs md:text-sm font-mono whitespace-pre-wrap break-all"><code>$ curl -X POST \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-API-KEY: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -d '{"to":"6281234567890","message":"Hello via API key!"}' \
  https://gate.ireng.uk/send-message</code></pre>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <h4 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Example with Cookie:</h4>
                                <div class="bg-gray-950 text-slate-100 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto border border-slate-900">
                                    <pre class="text-xs md:text-sm font-mono whitespace-pre-wrap break-all"><code>$ curl -X POST \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Cookie: auth-token=YOUR_COOKIE_HERE" \
  -d '{"to":"6281234567890","message":"Hello via cookie!"}' \
  https://gate.ireng.uk/send-message</code></pre>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Document Example -->
                            <div class="border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6 mt-6">
                                <h4 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Document Attachment Example:</h4>
                                <div class="bg-gray-950 text-slate-100 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto border border-slate-900">
                                    <pre class="text-xs md:text-sm font-mono whitespace-pre-wrap break-all"><code>$ curl -X POST \
  -H "X-API-KEY: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -F "to=6281234567890" \
  -F "caption=Dokumen terlampir" \
  -F "document=@/path/file.pdf" \
  https://gate.ireng.uk/send-document</code></pre>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Interactive Button Example -->
                            <div class="border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6 mt-6">
                                <h4 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Interactive Buttons Example:</h4>
                                <div class="bg-gray-950 text-slate-100 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto border border-slate-900">
                                    <pre class="text-xs md:text-sm font-mono whitespace-pre-wrap break-all"><code>$ curl -X POST \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-API-KEY: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -d '{
    "to":"6281234567890",
    "text":"Silakan pilih opsi di bawah:",
    "footer":"Pilih salah satu opsi",
    "interactiveButtons":[
      {"name":"quick_reply","buttonParamsJson":"{\"display_text\":\"Ya\",\"id\":\"btn_yes\"}"},
      {"name":"quick_reply","buttonParamsJson":"{\"display_text\":\"Tidak\",\"id\":\"btn_no\"}"},
      {"name":"quick_reply","buttonParamsJson":"{\"display_text\":\"Nanti\",\"id\":\"btn_later\"}"}
    ]
  }' \
  https://gate.ireng.uk/send-interactive</code></pre>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Interactive List Example -->
                            <div class="border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6 mt-6">
                                <h4 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Interactive List Example:</h4>
                                <div class="bg-gray-950 text-slate-100 rounded-xl p-4 overflow-x-auto border border-slate-900">
                                    <pre class="text-xs md:text-sm font-mono whitespace-pre-wrap break-all"><code>$ curl -X POST \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-API-KEY: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  -d '{
    "to":"6281234567890",
    "text":"Silakan pilih menu layanan:",
    "title":"Layanan Pelanggan",
    "footer":"Pilih dari list di bawah",
    "interactiveButtons":[{
      "name":"single_select",
      "buttonParamsJson":"{\"title\":\"Pilih Menu\",\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"Layanan\",\"rows\":[{\"header\":\"Cek Pesanan\",\"title\":\"Cek Pesanan\",\"description\":\"Lihat status pesanan\",\"id\":\"help_order\"},{\"header\":\"Info Produk\",\"title\":\"Info Produk\",\"description\":\"Tanya tentang produk\",\"id\":\"help_product\"}]}]}"
    }]
  }' \
  https://gate.ireng.uk/send-interactive</code></pre>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Dashboard Features Card -->
                    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800 p-4 md:p-6 mb-8 fade-in overflow-hidden break-words">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 md:mb-6">
                            <div class="pr-2">
                                <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100">Dashboard Features</h3>
                                <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Available features in the web dashboard</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14 bg-linear-to-br from-purple-100/10 to-purple-200/20 dark:from-purple-950/40 dark:to-purple-900/30 rounded-xl md:rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner flex-shrink-0">
                                <i class="ri-dashboard-3-line text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 text-lg md:text-2xl"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-950/20 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900/30">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                    <i class="ri-dashboard-line text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-xl"></i>
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-sm md:text-base">Dashboard</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">Real-time connection status, QR code generation, and recent messages.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="p-4 bg-green-50/50 dark:bg-green-950/20 rounded-xl border border-green-200 dark:border-green-900/30">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                    <i class="ri-touchpin-line text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-xl"></i>
