                                </div>
                                <p class="text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">Kirim pesan dengan tombol (button) dan list untuk meningkatkan interaksi dengan pengguna.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="p-4 bg-orange-50/50 dark:bg-orange-950/20 rounded-xl border border-orange-200 dark:border-orange-900/30">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                    <i class="ri-reply-all-line text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-xl"></i>
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-sm md:text-base">Balas Otomatis</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-300 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">Bot berbasis kata kunci dengan aktif/nonaktif per aturan dan sakelar global.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="p-4 bg-purple-50/50 dark:bg-purple-950/20 rounded-xl border border-purple-200 dark:border-purple-900/30">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                    <i class="ri-group-line text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 text-xl"></i>
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 text-sm md:text-base">Manajemen User</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">Kelola pengguna sistem, buat akun baru, dan atur peran (Admin/User).</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="p-4 bg-indigo-50/50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/30">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                    <i class="ri-key-line text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xl"></i>
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-sm md:text-base">Kunci API</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">Buat/cabut kunci untuk akses terprogram tanpa cookie sesi.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="p-4 bg-pink-50/50 dark:bg-pink-950/20 rounded-xl border border-pink-200 dark:border-pink-900/30">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                                    <i class="ri-webhook-line text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400 text-xl"></i>
                                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400 text-sm md:text-base">Integrasi Webhook</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-pink-700 dark:text-pink-300 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed"> Terima notifikasi real-time termasuk tombol yang ditekan pengguna untuk tracking interaksi.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Changelog & Resources Card -->
                    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800 p-4 md:p-6 fade-in overflow-hidden break-words">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 md:mb-6">
                            <div class="pr-2">
                                <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100">Catatan Perubahan & Sumber</h3>
                                <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Dokumentasi tambahan dan pembaruan</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14 rounded-xl md:rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-100 to-slate-200 dark:from-slate-800 dark:to-slate-900 shadow-inner flex-shrink-0">
                                <i class="ri-file-text-line text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg md:text-2xl"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="rounded-xl p-4 md:p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800">
                            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-350 mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">Untuk penjelasan lebih dalam, lihat dokumen Markdown yang disertakan dalam proyek:</p>

                            <div class="space-y-3">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
                                    <i class="ri-file-text-line text-blue-500 text-lg"></i>
                                    <code class="flex-1 text-xs font-mono px-2 py-1 rounded truncate text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">README.md</code>
                                </div>
